2026-06-03 16:47:23,866 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **HIGH - `subject_srv.exe` on DC and File Server**: The most significant finding is a non-standard 32-bit service binary (`C:\Windows\subject_srv.exe`) running as a Windows service (PID 5128) on the Domain Controller since 2018-09-06 22:11:15. It is present on both the DC and file server disk images, suggesting lateral deployment. It is absent from Amcache and placed in the Windows root directory - both indicators of manual/malicious deployment.
