2026-06-03 18:12:51,845 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] #### 🔴 HIGH Severity
2026-06-03 18:12:51,846 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **WMI-Based PowerShell Attack Chain** (f_96b5f018) — WmiPrvSE.exe spawned multiple PowerShell instances, which in turn spawned rundll32.exe for proxy execution. This is the **identical attack pattern** found on base-rd-01. The chain: WmiPrvSE.exe (PID 2676) → powershell.exe → powershell.exe (32-bit) → multiple rundll32.exe instances. One rundll32.exe (PID 7100) was **still running** at capture time, indicating persistent attacker access.
2026-06-03 18:12:51,849 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 2. **Inbound SMB from Compromised base-rd-01** (f_e331debb) — Active ESTABLISHED SMB connection from base-rd-01 (172.16.6.11), the confirmed compromised system with p.exe malware, to 172.16.7.15:445. Combined with the matching attack chain, this confirms lateral movement.
2026-06-03 18:12:51,850 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] #### 🟡 MEDIUM Severity
2026-06-03 18:12:51,851 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 3. **Active Network Connections** (f_e30263ff) — WinRM connections to base-elf (172.16.5.21:5985), SMB to BASE-FILE, RPC to DC, and McAfee management traffic. WinRM was enabled and actively used in both 2018 and 2021.
2026-06-03 18:12:51,853 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] #### 🔵 LOW Severity
2026-06-03 18:12:51,853 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 4. **WinRM Traffic from BASE-HUNT** (f_5e6aadcb) — Bulk-extracted HTTP logs show PowerShell remoting from the forensic workstation (172.16.5.25) to base-wkstn-01 on port 5985, predating the attack by 8 days. Likely legitimate forensic activity.
2026-06-03 18:12:51,855 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] #### ℹ️ INFORMATIONAL
2026-06-03 18:12:51,856 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 5. **System Profile** (f_438137a8) — Multi-session terminal server, multiple user accounts, dual AV
2026-06-03 18:12:51,856 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 6. **User Accounts** (f_690a816a) — Multiple domain users including admin accounts
2026-06-03 18:12:51,857 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 7. **No Malware on Disk** (f_b95d5b20) — Attack was fileless; no p.exe, ri.exe, or staging directories found
